---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';
---
<Base title="Write for us: guest posts on AI, finance and accounting" description="Guest post guidelines for practitioners and founders. Publish on AI bookkeeping, accounts payable, FP&A, tax automation and finance operations.">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Write for us</h1>
    <p class="lead">We publish guest posts from accountants, finance leaders, bookkeepers and founders who have actually used the tools they write about. Free if the article teaches something. Paid placement is available on the <a href="/submit-tool/">advertising page</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section prose fade-in">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Topics we want</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Honest tool reviews and head to head comparisons (with screenshots)</li>
      <li>How you cut month end close time, with numbers</li>
      <li>AI in accounts payable, expense management, forecasting, tax and audit</li>
      <li>Workflows, prompts and templates finance teams can copy today</li>
      <li>Lessons from implementing or ripping out a tool</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Requirements</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>1,000 words minimum, original, not published elsewhere</li>
      <li>Written by a named person with a real bio and LinkedIn profile</li>
      <li>One link to your company in the author bio. Contextual links to your product inside the article are a <a href="/submit-tool/">sponsored placement</a>.</li>
      <li>Links to sources, documentation and tools you reference are welcome and stay free</li>
      <li>We edit for clarity and may cut promotional language</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How to pitch</h2>
    <p>Send two or three headline ideas plus one sentence on why you are the right person to write each. Use the form below. We reply to every pitch within three business days.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section fade-in">
    <ContactForm subject="Guest post pitch" />
  </section>
</Base>
